{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Pokémon: The Arceus Chronicles","When Satoshi, Pikachu, and friends receive a mysterious message from the phantom Pokémon Arceus, they meet up with their old friend Takeshi and head to Mount Tengan to investigate. There, they find a rampaging Heatran and the group responsible—Team Galactic, previously thought to be dismantled. The team’s commanders are determined to find their missing leader by opening a gate between dimensions. With a trio of Legendary Pokémon and Sinnoh Champion Shirona on their side, our heroes have a lot of help, but they’ll need all they can get to save Sinnoh!\n\n\n(Source: Pokemon.com)\n\n\n\nNote: Special episodes of the Pocket Monsters anime distributed initially on Amazon Prime to promote the release of Pokémon LEGENDS: Arceus."],"ja":["ポケットモンスター (2019) 神とよばれし アルセウス",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-50673","ids":{"shikimori":50673,"mal":50673,"anilist":142794,"kodik":"serial-50984"},"kodikIds":["serial-45694","serial-45695","serial-50984"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-45694":"2023-11-21T16:38:30Z","serial-45695":"2022-09-24T10:23:14Z","serial-50984":"2023-05-13T12:13:52Z"},"title":"Покемон: Аркеус, названный богом","originalTitle":"Pocket Monsters: Kami to Yobareshi Arceus","alt":"Покемон: Хроники Аркеуса / Pocket Monsters: Arceus Who is Called a God / Pocket Monsters: The Hallowed God / Pokemon (2019): Kami to Yobareshi Arceus / Pokémon: The Arceus Chronicles Pokémon: The Arceus Chronicles ポケットモンスター (2019) 神とよばれし アルセウス","description":"4-серийный веб-сериал, транслировавшийся исключительно на Amazon Prime Video в честь выхода игры Pokémon Legends: Arceus для Nintendo Switch.","year":2022,"type":"ONA","genres":["детское","Экшен","Приключения","Комедия","Фэнтези"],"rating":6.67,"popularity":4932,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/50673/2473a7ca50cd6bf0a1af415d58ca1c5c.jpeg","width":700,"height":990},"backdrop":{